  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 115%;&quot;&gt;The proposed\r\ndevelopment, by reason of its siting in local surface water flood zones high\r\nand medium and fluvial flood zone 2, in the absence of an adequate Flood Risk\r\nAssessment to assess the future impacts and provide adequate mitigation\r\nmeasures, and in the absence of information demonstrating the proposal would\r\nnot damage the adjacent Open watercourse, would be likely to result in the\r\ndisplacement of water onto adjacent land and fail to provide resilience to\r\nflooding,&amp;nbsp; would be likely to result in harm to the adjacent watercourse, to\r\nthe detriment of the safety of future occupiers of the application site and\r\nadjacent sites. The proposal is therefore contrary to The National Planning Policy Framework (2024),&amp;nbsp; policies SI 12 and SI 13 of The London Plan (2021),\r\nand policies CN3, CN4 and CN5 of the Harrow Local Plan 2021-2041.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
